{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2023-04-05 01:45:00', 'title': 'ALPHABET INC. (NASDAQ: GOOGL, GOOG) SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION ALERT: BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST ALPHABET INC. (NASDAQ: GOOGL, GOOG)', 'text': 'DID YOU LOSE MONEY ON INVESTMENTS IN ALPHABET?\xa0 IF SO, PLEASE VISIT\xa0ALPHABET INC. SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT\xa0OR CONTACT\xa0 PETER ALLOCCO AT (212) 951-2030\xa0OR\xa0PALLOCCO@BERNLIEB.COM\xa0TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS.'}{'symbol': 'GOOG', 'date': '2023-04-05 01:45:00', 'title': 'ALPHABET INC. (NASDAQ: GOOGL, GOOG) SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION ALERT: BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST ALPHABET INC. (NASDAQ: GOOGL, GOOG)', 'text': 'DID YOU LOSE MONEY ON INVESTMENTS IN ALPHABET?\xa0 IF SO, PLEASE VISIT\xa0ALPHABET INC. SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT\xa0OR CONTACT\xa0 PETER ALLOCCO AT (212) 951-2030\xa0OR\xa0PALLOCCO@BERNLIEB.COM\xa0TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS.'}{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2023-04-05 19:00:00', 'title': 'SAMSUNG ELECTRONICS AND AMD EXTEND STRATEGIC IP LICENSING AGREEMENT TO BRING AMD RADEON™ GRAPHICS TO FUTURE MOBILE PLATFORMS', 'text': 'SEOUL, SOUTH KOREA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SAMSUNG ELECTRONICS CO., LTD., A WORLD LEADER IN ADVANCED SEMICONDUCTOR TECHNOLOGY, AND AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE SIGNED A MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT EXTENSION TO BRING MULTIPLE GENERATIONS OF HIGH-PERFORMANCE, ULTRA-LOW-POWER AMD RADEON GRAPHICS SOLUTIONS TO AN EXPANDED PORTFOLIO OF SAMSUNG EXYNOS SOCS.'}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2023-04-05 09:00:00', 'title': 'GLOBE SELECTS ANSYS TO REDUCE DEVELOPMENT COSTS FOR FUEL CELL SYSTEMS AND ACCELERATE INDUSTRIAL DECARBONIZATION', 'text': "ANSYS SIMULATION ENABLES GLOBE TO DEVELOP CARBON NEUTRAL, INTELLIGENT, MODULAR ENERGY SYSTEMS BASED ON ITS INNOVATIVE FUEL CELL TECHNOLOGY / KEY HIGHLIGHTS •\xa0 WITH SUPPORT FROM ANSYS C